# ============================================================================
# MyoMeasure — .gitignore
# The repo ships the reproducibility bundle for the paper: code + manuscript +
# figures + derived CSVs. Raw microscopy images are deposited on Zenodo (the
# paper-relevant subset) and available on request; everything heavy, regenerable,
# not used in this paper, or superseded is excluded. See RELEASE_MANIFEST.md.
# ============================================================================

# --- OS / editor / scratch ---
.DS_Store
~$*
.Rhistory
**/.Rhistory
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.bak
*.bak_*

# --- Never commit: archives, virtualenvs, node deps ---
archive/
**/venv/
**/node_modules/

# --- Raw microscopy data (Zenodo subset / on request) ---
*.vsi
/data/

# --- Inference QC artifacts (regenerable; not inputs to stats/figures) ---
**/*_measurement_overlay.png
**/*_cp_masks.tif
**/processing.log
/results/**/summary.png
/results/IGF_dexa_combined/*.png

# --- Result trees for experiments not analysed in this paper ---
/results/Experiment_1_inference/
/results/Experiment_2_inference/
/results/c26_cm_inference/
/results/CAF_C2C12_CM/
/results/Paul_ConditionMedia/
/results/Paul_Hypertrophy/
/results/IGF_dexa_plate005/*
!/results/IGF_dexa_plate005/measurements.csv
/results/IGF_dexa/*
!/results/IGF_dexa/measurements.csv
/results/c26_cm_exp2_inference/*
!/results/c26_cm_exp2_inference/measurements.csv

# --- Superseded manuscript drafts / figure decks (keep only the current set) ---
/reports/cell_reports_methods_paper.*
/reports/cell_reports_methods_paper_v3*
/reports/cell_reports_methods_paper_CG.docx
/reports/star_protocols_*
/reports/Figures.pptx
/reports/Supplementary_info.docx
/reports/Presubmission_inquiry_*
/reports/validation_report*.html
/reports/normality_per_image.csv
/reports/figures/
/reports/figures_v2/
/reports/paper_v3_stats/
/reports/final-methods/
/reports/**/test/
/reports/stats_final/Supplementary_tables_generated.xlsx

# --- Manuscript + figure deck: held back until their embedded revision history /
#     superseded slides are cleared (accept-all-changes; remove old slides), so nothing
#     unintended enters git history. Un-ignore and add before the public push.
#     See RELEASE_MANIFEST.md, "Open items". ---
/reports/cell_reports_methods_paper_CG_AB.docx
/reports/Figures_AB.pptx

# --- Not needed to run the pipeline or for the manuscript ---
# Legends ship as Markdown (.md); these .docx are pandoc duplicates.
/reports/figures_final/figure_legends.docx
/reports/stats_final/supplementary_table_legends.docx
# Lab SOP, not part of the pipeline or manuscript.
/MyoMeasure_treatment_protocol.docx
# Uncited extended analyses (not reported in the manuscript).
/results/IGF_dexa_combined/extended_stats.py
/results/IGF_dexa_combined/combined_hill_fit.csv
/results/IGF_dexa_combined/combined_log_dose_regression.csv

# --- Internal QA notes (kept local, not part of the public release) ---
/audit/

# --- Scripts: ship only the final paper pipeline + the Zenodo stager ---
/scripts/*
!/scripts/paper_scripts_final/
!/scripts/stage_zenodo_data.sh
/scripts/paper_scripts_final/__pycache__/

# --- Phantom test suite (committed); ignore only caches ---
/tests/__pycache__/
/tests/.pytest_cache/

# Zenodo staging output (built by scripts/stage_zenodo_data.sh)
/zenodo_data/

# Docker Scout SARIF scan outputs (large, regenerable; summarized in SECURITY.md)
/scout.json
/scout_all.json

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Repo scope (set 2026-08-25): this repository ships the PIPELINE and the
# analysis CODE only. It does not ship outputs or data.
#   * Figures, supplementary tables, legends and manuscript bookkeeping -> not
#     distributed here; they belong to the paper.
#   * Raw and derived data (measurements.csv, per-rater worksheets, stat CSVs)
#     -> Zenodo deposit. Stage it with scripts/stage_zenodo_data.sh.
# Analysis scripts (scripts/paper_scripts_final/, results/*/make_figures.py,
# myomeasure/) ARE tracked, so every figure and statistic remains inspectable
# and re-runnable once the Zenodo data is in place.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Manuscript outputs: figures, supplementary tables, legends
/reports/

# Data: raw per-myotube measurements and derived statistics -> Zenodo
/results/**/measurements.csv
/results/**/group_summary.csv
/results/IGF_dexa_combined/*.csv
/data/subset_blinded_validation/

# Keep the analysis scripts that live alongside the data
!/results/IGF_dexa_combined/make_figures.py

# Manuscript-revision bookkeeping (local only)
/NUMBERS_CHANGED.md
/PROSE_UPDATES_*.md
/RELEASE_MANIFEST.md
/check_figure_typography.py
/reports/_legend_backups_*/
/results/**/_archive_*/

# Figure-style helper package: ship the code, not the caches
/myomeasure/__pycache__/
